 00752          CHECK-DAILY-LIMIT.
 00753         *    The typed amount is left-justified text such as '999.5':
 00754         *    split it on the point and zero-fill both halves.
 00755              MOVE AMOUNTI TO AMT-TEXT.
 00756              MOVE SPACES TO AMT-INT-X AMT-DEC-X.
 00757              MOVE 18 TO AMT-END AMT-POINT.
 00758              PERFORM SCAN-AMOUNT VARYING AMT-I FROM 1 BY 1
 00759                  UNTIL AMT-I > 17.
 00760              IF AMT-POINT > AMT-END MOVE AMT-END TO AMT-POINT.
 00761              SUBTRACT 1 FROM AMT-POINT GIVING AMT-DIGITS.
 00762              IF AMT-DIGITS > 8 MOVE 8 TO AMT-DIGITS.
 00763              PERFORM COPY-INT-DIGIT VARYING AMT-I FROM 1 BY 1
 00764                  UNTIL AMT-I > AMT-DIGITS.
 00765              MOVE 0 TO AMT-T.
 00766              ADD 1 AMT-POINT GIVING AMT-I.
 00767              PERFORM COPY-DEC-DIGIT
 00768                  UNTIL AMT-I NOT < AMT-END OR AMT-T NOT < 8.
 00769              EXAMINE AMT-INT-X REPLACING ALL ' ' BY '0'.
 00770              EXAMINE AMT-DEC-X REPLACING ALL ' ' BY '0'.
 00771              MOVE AMT-INT-X TO AMT-INT-9.
 00772              MOVE AMT-DEC-X TO AMT-DEC-9.
 00773         *    Today's date, and the tracker record if there is one
 00774         *    EXEC KICKS ASKTIME ABSTIME(ABS-TIME) END-EXEC.
