 00877          SCAN-AMOUNT.
 00878         *    First point = end of the integer part; first blank = end.
 00879              IF AMT-CHAR (AMT-I) = '.' AND AMT-POINT = 18
 00880                  MOVE AMT-I TO AMT-POINT.
 00881              IF (AMT-CHAR (AMT-I) = ' ' OR AMT-CHAR (AMT-I) = LOW-VALUE)
 00882                  AND AMT-END = 18
 00883                  MOVE AMT-I TO AMT-END.
 00884
 00885          COPY-INT-DIGIT.
 00886         *    Right-align the integer digits in the 8-byte field.
 00887              COMPUTE AMT-T = 8 - AMT-DIGITS + AMT-I.
 00888              MOVE AMT-CHAR (AMT-I) TO AMT-INT-CHAR (AMT-T).
 00889
 00890          COPY-DEC-DIGIT.
 00891              ADD 1 TO AMT-T.
 00892              MOVE AMT-CHAR (AMT-I) TO AMT-DEC-CHAR (AMT-T).
 00893              ADD 1 TO AMT-I.
